[{"client_msg_id":"f7c9999a-01ae-4a57-abec-918649635f27","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/releases/tag/v1.10.0\u003e\n\nリリースしました。多分今後は `denops.vim` のリリース（タグを切る）というのは、殆ど起こらないと思います。","ts":"1631441289.004900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Suom"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1395331-5c62-4331-9bee-04062746f111","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Oculusのファームがこの前バージョンがあがったのですが、ランタイムのバージョンというのがあって、なるほどなと","ts":"1631441283.004800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6W0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d05add18-22dd-41dc-b8a0-6529be5a5eb2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そういえば、リリースバージョンとは別にランタイムバージョンとかの表示があるソフトとかもありますね","ts":"1631441258.003900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f9t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e867ed9-f9d7-4641-8fa4-5ab7b6321eed","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"IFのバージョンと開発のマイルストーンは一致しないこともあるし、バージョニング難しいですよね","ts":"1631441145.003200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JeW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a53882e7-1550-41f9-b57e-be6140594442","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"内部バージョンというか、そういうのが出てきそうw","ts":"1631441122.002700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kP0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49b49234-15af-4225-8f6c-c231f501c255","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"（むっちゃ癖でバージョン切りそうｗ）","ts":"1631440971.002200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=H/7a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"521f9e8a-88ef-4fff-95e8-475406d7df3e","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"denops.vim 自体のバージョニングポリシーを変更しようと思います。\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/116\u003e\n\n`denops/@denops` に変更があった場合（公開されているモジュールコードに変更があった場合）のみバージョンを上げるように変更します。","ts":"1631440909.001600","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/116|#116 :memo: Change versioning policy\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/116|#116 :memo: Change versioning policy\u003e","text":"SSIA","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1631440856}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":5,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UAZ33BKV2","U06ECBRTJ","U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y8jsT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb5c41f9-fedd-4ba4-ac98-f6f321af435a","type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"多分自分が設定ミスってるとかだと思うので、後でチェックします","ts":"1631435628.000000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zsrw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"502081d7-45a7-4b8c-a181-db4937cb24b6","type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"なるほど、しかし自分が理解し間違えていたというわけではなさそうです。例えば`Result`とすでに入力している状態で、`result`と入力したのにResultが候補に出てこないんですよね。自分の方こそ説明不足ですみません","ts":"1631435607.499500","thread_ts":"1631435607.499500","edited":{"user":"U025UTETFDJ","ts":"1631435666.000000"},"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rd+of"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cf63f5f-43d8-45f0-acce-ff7264dad349","type":"message","user":"U01G63H9VN3","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/deoplete.nvim/blob/18788fc822abd1ac1ffc1a8189afbfae15d06cf9/doc/deoplete.txt#L990\u003e\nこの挙動です","ts":"1631434261.498200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/deoplete.nvim/blob/18788fc822abd1a